  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2102.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2102.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to implement RSA 488 by establishing requirements relative to documenting the identity and location of water uses and collecting accurate water use data to support management of the state’s water resources.\n\nSource. #9279, eff 9-24-08; ss by #12135, eff 3-21-17",
